# Lorapok Core

- CommonJS only (`require` / `module.exports`)
- Use `lib/errors.js` and `lib/logger.js` — no silent catches
- Never commit secrets or `.env`
- Run `npm test` before finishing tasks that change code
- Read `BRAIN.md` and `.agents/rules/` at task start
